The film follows a new Ghostface killer who targets Sidney Prescott's daughter.

14
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
Following the exit of Scream (2022) and Scream VI directors Matt Bettinelli-Olpin and Tyler
Gillett in August 2023, Christopher Landon was hired to direct the seventh Scream film.

15
01:21:25,714 --> 01:21:31,714
However, the film went through a creative retooling after the departure of stars Melissa
Barrera and Jenna Ortega in late 2023, with Landon also exiting the project.

16
01:26:51,428 --> 01:26:57,428
